lay all 5 tasks with explanatory guidance (e.g., \\\"Write your vows - Personal vows add a heartfelt touch to your ceremony.\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Saved \\\"Ceremony Planning\\\" checklist to dashboard. Button changed from \\\"Save to Dashboard\\\" to \\\"Saved\\\". Dashboard updated: \\\"Checklists\\\" card shows \\\"1 saved\\\" (was 0), new \\\"Your Saved Checklists\\\" section appeared with \\\"Ceremony Planning\\\" showing \\\"0 of 5 completed\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Budget validation not enforced - zero value was accepted\", \"actual\": \"Entered budget 0 and it was saved; dashboard now shows Budget: $0. Expected: should reject zero and keep previous value $100,000.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Guest count validation not enforced - negative value was accepted\", \"actual\": \"Entered guest count -50 and it was saved; dashboard now shows Guest Count: \\\"-50\\\". Expected: should reject negative value and keep previous value 250.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After reload: Favorite venues (1 saved - \\\"Rosewood Garden Estate\\\") still available in dashboard. Saved checklists (1 saved - \\\"Ceremony Planning\\\" with 1 of 5 completed) still available. Wedding details (Carol Davis & Bob Smith, Dec 25, 2026, $75,000, 200 guests) persisted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Date validation not enforced - past date was accepted\", \"actual\": \"Entered past date 2026-08-20 (current date is 2026-08-25) and it was saved; dashboard now shows \\\"Aug 20, 2026\\\". Expected: should reject past date and keep previous value 2026-12-25.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"View Details button does not open venue/vendor de